The wallpaper images themselves were gathered from various sources around the internet and are not original work. Rights to those images belong to their original artists and photographers. This repository does not claim ownership of the images and they are shared here for personal, non-commercial use only. If you are the creator of an image in this repository and would like credit added or the image removed, please open an issue.
